  "kind": "bit-matching-detail",
  "title": "Multiplication and division double-round through x87 64-bit significand precision and flush subnormal results to +0",
  "statement": "In Excel 16.0.20527.20088, * and / coerce operands left-to-right to numbers, evaluate at x87 64-bit significand precision (PC64) before rounding to binary64 (differing by 1 ULP from binary64 single rounding on dc6qki_arith rows 1-24, e.g. 0.0989043*6004.60993 = 0x40828f0dceb275c2 vs nearest ...75c3), and flush any subnormal product or quotient to +0 (2.3E-308/2 = 0 and 1E-307*0.01 = 0, while normal 5E-308/2 stays 2.5E-308).",
  "status": "measured",
  "basis": "Measured across Excel 16.0.20527.20088 in dc6qki_arith (rows 1-24) and jnt_operators (rows 14-15, 17, 22-24).",
